      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense, undulating periodization sounds like a solid way to avoid another crash. \n\none other thing though, my client is getting pretty frustrated. they feel like they're just stuck in this weird, stagnant loop where no matter what they do, nothing changes. it almost feels like they're fighting against some invisible force that's just holding them back. how do you explain that feeling of being 'stalled' to a client from a coaching perspective?",
